# No AI co-authors on commits

- NEVER add `Co-authored-by:` trailers for Cursor, Copilot, Claude, or any AI/agent.
- NEVER add co-author metadata via commit message hooks, trailers, or `-m` extras.
- Commits must be authored only as the human user (Azhartula / local git identity).
- If a tool tries to inject a co-author, strip it before committing.
